From: baizhi958216
Subject: [PATCH] envsetup: Return success after optional OrangeFox VTS cleanup

The fox_12.1 sync patch ends orangefox_envsetup() with a file test. An absent
or empty optional VTS makefile makes source envsetup.sh return 1 and stops
build wrappers using set -e before lunch.

--- a/envsetup.sh
+++ b/envsetup.sh
@@ -1913,6 +1913,7 @@ function orangefox_envsetup() {
     fi
    # export OF_MANUAL_COPY_TWRES=1
    [ -s $FOX_MANIFEST_ROOT/frameworks/base/services/core/xsd/vts/Android.mk ] && echo -n "" > $FOX_MANIFEST_ROOT/frameworks/base/services/core/xsd/vts/Android.mk
+   return 0
 }
 
 orangefox_envsetup
